# Scene 6: work that comes back — a loop in a background agent while Glut is open, round after round until its goal is
# reached, and a plan that runs while Glut is closed: made, run once now, its result in the Runs tab, removed again.
size 130 37
project shop
home fresh
setting lsp false
allow "Bash(python3 *)"
on "Glut asks" key y
run glut --provider anthropic --model claude-sonnet-5-5 --lang en
wait 20 "⏎ send"
pause 1.2
type "/loop 20s add one edge-case test a round to test_prices.py (zero, rounding, an empty cart), run the tests; end the loop once three are in"
pause 0.8
key enter
wait 10 "starts: every"
pause 4
type "/schedule add nightly --at 02:00 --mode build --provider anthropic --model claude-sonnet-5-5 --allow \"Bash(python3 *)\" run the tests and say in one line what fails"
pause 0.8
key enter
wait 10 "plan nightly made:"
pause 5
type "/schedule run nightly"
pause 0.6
key enter
wait 10 "runs now beside Glut"
pause 2
type "/schedule"
pause 0.6
key enter
wait 300 "✓ answered" x3
pause 5
key esc
pause 1
type "/loop"
pause 0.6
key enter
pause 4
wait 600 "loop loop ended" x3
pause 5
type "/schedule remove nightly"
pause 0.6
key enter
wait 10 "plan nightly removed"
pause 3
end
